 "<h2>Fair odds</h2><p class=\"muted small\">Packs are earned by showing up and never sold. These are the odds for every Forgeling you find.</p>\n    <table class=\"odds\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Pull</th>{0}</tr></thead><tbody>\n    <tr><td>Daily</td>{1}</tr>\n    <tr><td>All in</td>{2}</tr>\n    <tr><td>Pack</td>{3}</tr>\n    <tr><td>Last in pack</td>{4}</tr></tbody></table>\n    <p class=\"small\"><b>Safety net.</b> After {5} Forgelings without a Rare or better, your next one is guaranteed to be Rare or better. You are {6} away right now.</p>\n    <p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">These are pilot odds. They may change before launch, and any change will be shown here.</p>\n    <div class=\"row\" style=\"justify-content:center;margin-top:8px\"><button class=\"ghost\" data-close>Close</button></div>": "<h2>公正な確率</h2><p class=\"muted small\">パックは毎日来ることで手に入り、販売されることはありません。見つかるすべてのフォージリングの確率はこちらです。</p>\n    <table class=\"odds\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">入手</th>{0}</tr></thead><tbody>\n    <tr><td>毎日</td>{1}</tr>\n    <tr><td>全力</td>{2}</tr>\n    <tr><td>パック</td>{3}</tr>\n    <tr><td>パックの最後</td>{4}</tr></tbody></table>\n    <p class=\"small\"><b>救済のしくみ。</b>レア以上が出ないまま{5}体見つけると、次の1体は必ずレア以上になります。今はあと{6}体です。</p>\n    <p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">これはテスト期間中の確率です。公開前に変わることがあり、変わった場合はここに表示されます。</p>\n    <div class=\"row\" style=\"justify-content:center;margin-top:8px\"><button class=\"ghost\" data-close>閉じる</button></div>",
 "You have {0} {1} times.": "{0}ことが{1}回あります。",
 "After {0} {1} days. {2} so far.": "{0}の{1}の日を重ねると。これまで{2}日。",
 "your first calling": "最初の道しるべ",
 " callings done": "回の道しるべ",
 "After {0}. {1} so far.": "{0}のあとで。これまで{1}。",
 "<h2>By the fire, {0} of {1}</h2><p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Things appear by the fire as you keep doing your callings. Nothing here can be bought or lost.</p><ul class=\"furn\">{2}</ul>": "<h2>火のそばに {0}/{1}</h2><p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">道しるべを続けるうちに、火のそばにものが増えていきます。ここにあるものは買うことも、失うこともありません。</p><ul class=\"furn\">{2}</ul>",
 "<h3 style=\"margin:14px 0 0\">Something to try now</h3><p class=\"muted small\">At the Hearth, send {0} out to wander. This first time they are back in about 20 minutes, with something small for your shelf.</p>": "<h3 style=\"margin:14px 0 0\">今すぐ試せること</h3><p class=\"muted small\">炉ばたで、{0}を旅に出してみましょう。初回は20分ほどで、棚に飾る小さなものを持って帰ってきます。</p>",
 "<button class=\"primary\" id=\"fdHearth\">Go to the Hearth</button>": "<button class=\"primary\" id=\"fdHearth\">炉ばたへ行く</button>",
 "Maybe later": "またあとで",
 "Got it": "わかった",
 "before you started": "始める前",
 "showed up": "来た日",
 ", your own small thing done": "、自分の小さなこともできた",
 "<span><i class=\"ownkey\"></i>your own small thing</span>": "<span><i class=\"ownkey\"></i>自分の小さなこと</span>",
 "<p class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">You did your own small thing on {0} of these days{1}.</p>": "<p class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">このうち{0}日、自分の小さなことができました{1}。</p>",
 "<div class=\"panel-box\"><h2>The last five weeks</h2><p class=\"muted small\">Showed up on {0} of these days. Gaps are just gaps.</p><div class=\"cal\">{1}{2}</div><div class=\"calkey\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span><i style=\"background-image:var(--stF)\"></i>showed up</span><span><i style=\"background-image:var(--stM)\"></i>rested</span>{3}</div>{4}</div>": "<div class=\"panel-box\"><h2>この5週間</h2><p class=\"muted small\">このうち{0}日来ました。あいた日は、ただのあいた日です。</p><div class=\"cal\">{1}{2}</div><div class=\"calkey\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span><i style=\"background-image:var(--stF)\"></i>来た日</span><span><i style=\"background-image:var(--stM)\"></i>休んだ日</span>{3}</div>{4}</div>",
 "What confused you, if anything?": "わかりにくかったことはありますか？",
 "What do you wish Forgelings did?": "Forgelingsに、どんなことをしてほしいですか？",
 "Would you keep using it? Why or why not?": "これからも使いたいですか？その理由は？",
 "Saved. You can change these anytime.": "保存しました。いつでも書き直せます。",
 "Nothing saved yet. These stay on this device until you copy your report.": "まだ何も保存されていません。レポートをコピーするまで、この端末の中だけにあります。",
 "<button class=\"primary\" id=\"fbSave\" style=\"margin-top:4px\">Save my notes</button><p class=\"muted small\" id=\"fbSaved\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">{0}</p>": "<button class=\"primary\" id=\"fbSave\" style=\"margin-top:4px\">メモを保存</button><p class=\"muted small\" id=\"fbSaved\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">{0}</p>",
 "Find a curio first. Send a Forgeling wandering.": "まずは珍品を見つけましょう。フォージリングを旅に出してみて。",
 "Everyone is out wandering. Try again when they are back.": "みんな旅に出ています。帰ってきたら、もう一度どうぞ。",
 "<div class=\"lbl2\">Who sends it</div><div class=\"gwho\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Who sends it\">{0}</div>": "<div class=\"lbl2\">送り主</div><div class=\"gwho\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"送り主\">{0}</div>",
 "<div class=\"lbl2\">A curio</div><div class=\"gpick\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Which curio\">{0}</div>": "<div class=\"lbl2\">珍品</div><div class=\"gpick\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"どの珍品か\">{0}</div>",
 "<div class=\"lbl2\">Or something you forged</div><div class=\"gpick\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Which forged charm\">{0}</div>": "<div class=\"lbl2\">または、あなたが作ったもの</div><div class=\"gpick\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"どのお守りか\">{0}</div>",
 "<h2>Send a gift to a friend</h2><p class=\"muted small\">Your friend gets a link that opens in their own Forgelings. A curio goes on their shelf, and a charm goes in their Forge. You keep yours.</p>\n    {0}{1}\n    {2}\n    <label class=\"field\"><span>A short note (optional)</span><input id=\"giftNote\" maxlength=\"80\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"For example: this made me think of you\"></label>\n    <p class=\"muted small\">The link holds only the gift, your Forgeling’s name and look, and your note. It goes only where you send it.</p>\n    <div class=\"stack\"><button class=\"primary\" id=\"giftGo\">Send the link</button></div><div class=\"row\" style=\"justify-content:center\"><button class=\"ghost\" data-close>Not now</button></div>": "<h2>友だちに贈り物をする</h2><p class=\"muted small\">友だちには、その人のForgelingsで開くリンクが届きます。珍品は棚に、お守りは鍛冶場に届きます。あなたの分はそのまま残ります。</p>\n    {0}{1}\n    {2}\n    <label class=\"field\"><span>ひとことメッセージ（任意）</span><input id=\"giftNote\" maxlength=\"80\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"例：これを見て、あなたを思い出しました\"></label>\n    <p class=\"muted small\">リンクに含まれるのは、贈り物、あなたのフォージリングの名前と見た目、メッセージだけです。あなたが送った相手にだけ届きます。</p>\n    <div class=\"stack\"><button class=\"primary\" id=\"giftGo\">リンクを送る</button></div><div class=\"row\" style=\"justify-content:center\"><button class=\"ghost\" data-close>今はやめておく</button></div>",
 "<p class=\"muted\">Your Forgelings and their tales appear here once you find your first one.</p>": "<p class=\"muted\">最初のフォージリングを見つけると、ここにその子たちとお話が並びます。</p>",
 "Forgeling@talesHTML": "体",
 "Forgelings@talesHTML": "体",
 ", {0} with a tale of yours": "、うち{0}体にあなたのお話",
 "<div class=\"group\"><button class=\"rowl\" id=\"fgTales\"><span class=\"ri fgstack\" aria-hidden=\"true\">{0}</span><span class=\"rt\"><b>Your Forgelings' tales</b><span class=\"rs\">{1} {2}{3}. Names, tales and second readings.</span></span><span class=\"chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\">›</span></button></div>": "<div class=\"group\"><button class=\"rowl\" id=\"fgTales\"><span class=\"ri fgstack\" aria-hidden=\"true\">{0}</span><span class=\"rt\"><b>フォージリングたちのお話</b><span class=\"rs\">{1}{2}{3}。名前、お話、二度めの読み。</span></span><span class=\"chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\">›</span></button></div>",
 "<h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Your Forgelings</h2>": "<h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">あなたのフォージリング</h2>",
 "Reminders@remindHTML": "リマインダー",
 "Each day at ": "毎日 ",
