 "<div class=\"stview\" style=\"--sg:#C9B8FF\"><p class=\"rv-title\">{0}’s statue, in clay</p><p class=\"stsub\">A preview · {1}</p>\n    <div class=\"stcan\"><canvas id=\"stCv\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A clay preview of {2}'s statue. Drag to turn it, pinch or scroll to zoom, arrow keys to turn.\"></canvas><p class=\"stno\" id=\"stNo\" hidden>This phone could not start 3D drawing, so here is {3} as on the card.<img src=\"{4}\" alt=\"{5}\"></p></div>\n    <p class=\"rv-hint\">This is {6}’s shape. When {7} is Forgebound, cast it at the Forge for {8} embers and it comes to life in full colour, wearing its keepsake, on a stand from {9}.</p>\n    <div class=\"row stbtns\"><button class=\"chip\" id=\"stTurn\" aria-pressed=\"{10}\">Turntable</button></div>\n    <button class=\"ghost\" id=\"ovClose\">Close</button></div>": "<div class=\"stview\" style=\"--sg:#C9B8FF\"><p class=\"rv-title\">粘土でできた{0}の像</p><p class=\"stsub\">プレビュー · {1}</p>\n    <div class=\"stcan\"><canvas id=\"stCv\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"{2}の像の粘土プレビュー。ドラッグで回転、ピンチかスクロールで拡大、矢印キーで回転。\"></canvas><p class=\"stno\" id=\"stNo\" hidden>この端末では3D表示を始められなかったので、カードの{3}を表示しています。<img src=\"{4}\" alt=\"{5}\"></p></div>\n    <p class=\"rv-hint\">これが{6}の形です。{7}が絆の証を得たら、鍛冶場で残り火{8}つを使って鋳造すると、宝物を身につけたフルカラーの姿で、{9}の台座にのって命を吹きこまれます。</p>\n    <div class=\"row stbtns\"><button class=\"chip\" id=\"stTurn\" aria-pressed=\"{10}\">回転台</button></div>\n    <button class=\"ghost\" id=\"ovClose\">閉じる</button></div>",
